,"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#label-guidelines","content":"Keep labels short (1-5 words when possible)"},"390":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-56","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#label-guidelines","content":"Ensure labels are descriptive without being verbose"},"391":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-57","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#label-guidelines","content":"Place the most commonly selected options first in groups"},"392":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-58","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#validation","content":"Always provide clear error messages and use appropriate validation states:"},"393":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-59","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#group-organization","content":"Limit checkbox groups to 7-10 options for better usability"},"394":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-60","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#group-organization","content":"Use logical ordering (alphabetical, frequency of use, or importance)"},"395":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-61","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#group-organization","content":"Consider using CheckboxGroup for related options, even if there are only 2-3"},"396":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-62","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#group-organization","content":"Provide a group label that clearly describes the choice being made"},"397":{"id":"/docs/components/chip","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","type":"page","content":"Chip","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Components"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chip"},"398":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-0","page_id":"/docs/com