umn that grows to fill)."],[1380,"**`CornerActions`** - an always-visible structural row for actions placed at a surface corner."],[372,"**`FieldError`**: Displays validation error text below the group"],[1377,"**`Footer`** — the bottom region: secondary content and/or actions (a `<footer>` row that spaces its contents apart)."],[1379,"**`Group`** — semantic grouping container for field item controls. A parent field injects the box chrome."],[1376,"**`Header`** — the top region: title area and optional trailing close (a `<header>` row that spaces its contents apart)."],[685,"**`icon.content`**: Overrides the BentoIllustration component - affects SVG transformations (rotate, flip), accessibility attributes (`role`, `focusable`, `aria-labelledby`), viewBox calculations, and final SVG element rendering"],[684,"**`icon`**: Overrides the entire BentoIcon component - affects icon loading, caching, sprite/SVG mode switching, data attributes, and the overall icon wrapper"],[692,"**`ondemand(loader)`**: Register an asynchronous icon loader (returns unregister function)"],[693,"**`parser(svgString)`**: Parse SVG strings into React elements"],[691,"**`set(icons)`**: Synchronously add icons to the store"],[1557,"**`size` is the tier.** The eyebrow reads it on the `detail` ramp, the title on `heading`, and\nthe body on `body`, so there is no table to memorize. Without `size`, the lockup follows the\nsurrounding size scope. A tier is the same at every container width."],[1130,"**A step isn't clickable:** it has no `onPress`, so it's inert by design. Add `onPress` to make it interactive."],[673,"**Accessibility ready**: Built-in support for screen readers and keyboard navigation"],[221,"**Accessibility ready**: Keyboard navigation, screen reader support, and semantic HTML"],[677,"**Accessibility**: `aria-label`, `aria-describedby`, `role`, `title`"],[1383,"**Adopted** - inside a parent that provides its context (e.g. `Modal`), it picks up that parent's styling and spacing automatically. Consumer props still win over the adopted defaults."],[1521,"**Adornments**: Fixed text or icons before or after the input (e.g. `$`, `.00`, `px`) are composed inside `Group`, positioned by source order"],[1555,"**An explicit prop on a child always wins** over what the lockup supplies. Pass\n`<Tag slot=\"eyebrow\" size=\"sm\">` to break the pairing, for instance."],[1163,"**Arrow Down/Right**: Move to next radio button"],[1285,"**Arrow Left/Right**: Move to next/previous segment"],[936,"**Arrow Right/Left**: open/close a submenu"],[935,"**Arrow Up/Down**: move between items; **Home/End**: first/last"],[1164,"**Arrow Up/Left**: Move to previous radio button"],[236,"**Auto-sizing**: Uses VisX's `useParentSize` hook to adapt to container width"],[670,"**Automatic caching**: Once loaded, icons are cached for optimal performance"],[724,"**Automatic Caching**: Once loaded, the icon is cached in memory to avoid subsequent network requests"],[232,"**Bar padding** (multi-series): 4px between bars within a group"],[231,"**Bar width**: 12px (1.5 grid units)"],[675,"**Bento integration**: Extends Bento Icon with additional Antares-specific features"],[234,"**Border radius**: 8px on all bars"],[1635,"**Center** — when the group acts as a prominent toggle affecting an entire section or page."],[322,"**Chart container:** `data-width`, `data-height`, `data-x-labels`, `data-y-labels`, `data-x-labels-vertical`, `data-x-baseline`, `data-y-baseline`, `data-x-tick-marks`, `data-y-tick-marks`"],[748,"**Check browser console**: Look for network errors"],[270,"**Check container**: Ensure the chart container is not transformed or positioned in a complex layout"],[265,"**Check data**: Ensure `series` array has data and `xAccessor`/`yAccessor` return valid values"],[267,"**Check dimensions**: Ensure container has non-zero width and height"],[266,"**Check domains**: Verify `yDomain` (if set) includes your data values"],[746,"**Check icon name**: Ensure the icon exists in the CDN"],[269,